{"id": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN#0018", "file": "MINIGAME/JT02MARI.SBN", "offset": 4938, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f2c9f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81442f2ff0a5f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff349f186f0aef0a4f957f287f29ef0cef0b8f0cf8144", "text": "알겠습니다．//하지만…//봐 드리지는 않겠습니다．", "baseline_text": "알겠습니다．//하지만…//봐드리지는 않겠습니다．", "kind": "ascr", "review": "번역 검수", "source": "わかりました。//ですが……//手加減はいたしませんよ。", "pointer_offset": 4068}
